    "X Wing": {
      "formatVersion": 1,
      "name": "X Wing",
      "notes": "A fighter. It goes after other fighters, and shoots at what makes one dangerous rather than at what holds it together: a laser this light does nothing useful to a capital's plating, but it can strip the guns and engines off anything its own size — and off a capital, once its own size has run out. It goes in fast and close, since a fighter that stands off from a capital is only a slower target.",
